# Pinned external binary versions for reproducible Hyprwave image builds.
# Sourced by build.sh during the container build (path: /ctx/versions.env).
#
# How to bump: planning/integration/a-stabilize/BUMP.md (worked example included)
# Validate:    planning/integration/a-stabilize/scripts/verify-pins.sh
#              verify-pins.sh --checksum   # full download + sha256
# Do not use GitHub /releases/latest URLs — pins must be versioned.
# CI: .github/workflows/build.yml job pin_guards enforces keys + HEAD reachability.

### Yazi (terminal file manager) — https://github.com/sxyazi/yazi
YAZI_VERSION=v26.5.6
YAZI_URL="https://github.com/sxyazi/yazi/releases/download/${YAZI_VERSION}/yazi-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip"
YAZI_SHA256=1c9096f0a83b8102c194385f644cdeff93cc8269426163c9d033041ebd537bd2

